  "notes": "A round fieldstone watchtower 8 m across at its battered foot and 22.5 m to its parapet, its crown broken away on the +X+Z side down to 14 m and the fallen stones heaped below; door on local -Z under a slate lintel, a cantilevered stone stair climbing the inside past slit windows to the wall walk. It carves nothing.",
